                                        </td> *@
                                    </tr>
                                }
                            }
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>

        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-4">
            Tracker: 4-eyes enforced · QA Reject reopens case + emails maker · SLA configurable per type/risk · Stale flag at @(Model.SavedViews.FirstOrDefault()?.Id ?? 0) · Cycle-time chart of last 30 days · Audit log captures every action.
        </p>
